<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8692" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Clymĕnē</span></b> ,
			ēs, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κλυμένη</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The wife of the Ethiopian king Merops</i>, <i>and mother of Phaëthon by Sol</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 1,
				756</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 765</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 37</span></i>; 4,
			204.—Gr. acc. Clymenen, Ov.  M.
			1, 756.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Clymĕnēïus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>of</i>
			or <i>pertaining to Clymene</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">proles = Phaëthon,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					2, 19</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Clymĕ-nēïs</span></b> ,
				ĭdis, f., <i>a
				daughter of Clymene</i>, <i><span class="en">Albin. ad Liv. 1,
			111</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>One of the daughters of Oceanus</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 4,
				345</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A female servant and confidante of Helen</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. H. 16,
				257</span></i>; <i><span class="en">17, 267</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Dict.
				Cret. 1, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5,
			13</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>An Amazon</i>, <i><span class="en">Hyg. Fab.
				163</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
